aset_extended.csv","@type":"cr:RecordSet","name":"used_car_price_dataset_extended.csv","description":"\n| Filename                             | Description                                        | Rows   | Format |\n|--------------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------|--------|--------|\n| \u0060used_car_price_dataset_extended.csv\u0060| Full dataset with 10,000 used car records          | 10,000 | CSV    |\n\n"}],"version":1,"keywords":["data type \u003E tabular","subject \u003E science and technology \u003E transportation \u003E automobiles and vehicles","audience \u003E beginner","task \u003E regression"],"isAccessibleForFree":true,"includedInDataCatalog":{"@type":"sc:DataCatalog","name":"Kaggle","url":"https://www.kaggle.com"},"creator":{"@type":"sc:Person","name":"therohithanand","url":"/therohithanand","image":"https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/default-thumb.png"},"publisher":{"@type":"sc:Organization","name":"Kaggle","url":"https://www.kaggle.com/organizations/kaggle","image":"https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-organizations/4/thumbnail.png"},"thumbnailUrl":"https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-datasets-images/7621150/12105334/4f8bc06caa740297f3434299ea985978/dataset-card.png?t=2025-06-09-08-15-03","dateModified":"2025-06-09T08:04:12.57","datePublished":"2025-06-09T08:04:56.5236252","@type":"sc:Dataset","name":"Used Car Price Prediction","url":"https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/therohithanand/used-car-price-prediction/versions/1","description":"#  Used Car Price Estimation Dataset\n\n##  Overview\nThis dataset contains **10,000 realistic entries** of used cars with various features such as mileage, engine size, number of previous owners, fuel type, and more. It is designed for **regression tasks** where the goal is to **predict the resale price** of a car in USD.\n\nIt\u2019s perfect for:\n- Practicing regression models\n- Exploring feature importance\n- Building interactive dashboards\n- Training ML models for real-world pricing prediction\n\n\n##  Use Cases\n- **Regression**: Predict \u0060price_usd\u0060 using the other features.\n- **Feature Engineering**: Create new features like car age, fuel economy score, etc.\n- **Data Visualization**: Analyze how different factors like engine size or brand impact price.\n- **Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)**: Great for beginners to learn cleaning and insights.\n\n\n##  Format\n- **File type**: CSV  \n- **Rows**: 10,000  \n- **File name**: \u0060used_car_price_dataset_extended.csv\u0060\n\n\n##  License \u0026 Credits\nThis dataset is **synthetically generated** and does not represent any real-world individual\u0027s data. Free to use for learning, teaching, and experimentation.\n"}